          },
          "description": "In this game, you'll navigate a game board with 80-numbered squares on it, using only audio cues. Follow spoken directions to move forward, backward, left, and right, with your goal being to end up on the correct square at the end of the game. You'll have 8 seconds between each step. \nIt's designed to help kids develop several important skills, including: auditory processing, spatial awareness, attention to detail, quick thinking, sequential processing, number recognition and lateralization.",
